%N A398359 Decimal expansion of Sum_{k>=0} (-1)^k * H(2*k+1,2) / (2*k+1), where H(k,2) = A007406(k)/A007407(k) is the k-th generalized harmonic number of order 2.
%H A398359 Ali Shadhar Olaikhan, <a href="https://www.researchgate.net/publication/373488370">An Introduction to the Harmonic Series and Logarithmic Integrals</a>, 2nd ed., 2023, section 4.5.4, p. 333, eq. (4.128).
%H A398359 <a href="/index/Ha#harmonic">Index entries for sequences related to harmonic numbers</a>.
%F A398359 Equals -2*Im(Li_3(1+i)) + 17*Pi^3/192 + Pi*log(2)^2/8 + log(2)*G/2, where i is the imaginary unit, and G is Catalan's constant (A006752).
%F A398359 Equals 2*Im(Li_3((1+i)/2)) - Pi^3/48 - Pi*log(2)^2/16 + log(2)*G/2.
%e A398359 0.717303472535687894665485837524646050536504673597335...
